69
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:34,877
We were attacked by a giant whale?

70
00:06:35,217 --> 00:06:35,917
You got it.

71
00:06:36,357 --> 00:06:37,697
It swallowed you guys whole,

72
00:06:37,797 --> 00:06:39,477
but I managed to easily defeat it

73
00:06:39,477 --> 00:06:40,957
and pull you two out of its belly.

74
00:06:40,957 --> 00:06:44,117
Wow, you did all that?

75
00:06:44,417 --> 00:06:45,177
Thank you.

76
00:06:45,477 --> 00:06:47,397
Does our brave savior have a name?

77
00:06:47,457 --> 00:06:48,997
That's the million berry question!

78
00:06:49,897 --> 00:06:51,977
I am the fearless and much feared leader

79
00:06:51,977 --> 00:06:54,937
of the notorious pirate crew that rules over the East Blue!

80
00:06:55,217 --> 00:06:57,577
The people fear me and love me in equal measure!

81
00:06:57,877 --> 00:07:01,157
I am known as the intrepid Captain Usopp!

82
00:07:03,977 --> 00:07:04,497
Wow!

83
00:07:05,237 --> 00:07:07,017
You mean the Captain Usopp?

84
00:07:07,397 --> 00:07:08,337
