90
00:07:18,117 --> 00:07:19,797
8,000 men?!

91
00:07:19,797 --> 00:07:22,597
Oh, and, uh, you both joined up as my servants yesterday!

92
00:07:23,057 --> 00:07:23,837
We did!

93
00:07:26,157 --> 00:07:27,117
