101
00:07:39,117 --> 00:07:39,997
No one mocks me!

102
00:07:40,457 --> 00:07:42,597
I've got too much pride for mockery, dammit!

103
00:07:42,957 --> 00:07:44,797
In fact, I've got so much pride,

104
00:07:44,897 --> 00:07:47,297
