286
00:14:24,797 --> 00:14:26,557
If you really want to know,

287
00:14:26,677 --> 00:14:28,617
then I suggest you check the logbook in your room.

288
00:14:29,197 --> 00:14:29,477
Huh?

289
00:14:29,957 --> 00:14:31,517
And if I remember correctly,

290
00:14:31,737 --> 00:14:34,077
there's even a picture of your Bellomere inside of it.

291
00:14:51,197 --> 00:14:52,517
It's my handwriting.

292
00:14:52,517 --> 00:15:03,717
Bellomere!

293
00:15:17,717 --> 00:15:18,037
Bellomere!

