Look how many I got!

297
00:15:22,517 --> 00:15:24,377
A bunch of them are still green!

298
00:15:24,777 --> 00:15:25,697
Come on, Nami!

299
00:15:26,217 --> 00:15:27,017
Pay attention!

300
00:15:27,597 --> 00:15:28,017
