303
00:15:31,597 --> 00:15:32,217
They're merchandise!

304
00:15:32,777 --> 00:15:33,757
It's okay, girls.

305
00:15:33,917 --> 00:15:35,577
We can have a few of them for ourselves.

306
00:15:35,917 --> 00:15:36,277
Yeah!

307
00:15:36,697 --> 00:15:38,437
You're a real meanie, Nojiko!

308
00:15:38,757 --> 00:15:39,657
I'm what?

309
00:15:41,097 --> 00:15:42,637
All right, go on.

310
00:15:42,877 --> 00:15:43,857
Get back to work.

311
00:15:43,857 --> 00:15:52,557
I have to go back.

312
00:15:52,557 --> 00:15:55,417
Something bad might have happened to Kokoyashi Village.

313
00:15:55,417 --> 00:16:07,237
So then, what exactly is it?

314
00:16:07,237 --> 00:16:07,537
It's a talking reindeer!

315
00:16:07,537 --> 00:16:08,157
It's a talking reindeer!

316
00:16:08,157 --> 00:16:08,657
I have to go!

317
