330
00:16:48,117 --> 00:16:49,117
It is?

331
00:16:49,117 --> 00:16:54,117
Yes. He is a truly brilliant doctor. Better than any human you'll meet.

332
00:16:54,117 --> 00:16:56,117
Isn't that right?

333
00:16:56,117 --> 00:17:03,117
Shut up! You can praise me all you want, you stupid human, but don't think I like it or anything!

334
00:17:03,117 --> 00:17:05,117
Really? You look like you do.

335
00:17:05,117 --> 00:17:11,117
His name's Chopper. He's a reindeer, but he ate the human human fruit and gained human abilities.

336
00:17:11,117 --> 00:17:15,117
